### note: Source-derived Ergon Showcase mutation reference (localhost:8080), not deployed on the public Quickstart host. Creates an interim substitution for AUSENCIA_EVENTUAL (ERGadm00364 / PCK_SUBST_AUSENC_EV / ERG-01311) using composite wire identity substitutoId without requiring a formal vacation or leave impediment record.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@sessionCookie = replace-with-ERGONSESSION-cookie-value
@xsrfToken = replace-with-XSRF-TOKEN-cookie-value
@orgao = 2

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ergon/substituicoes
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: ERGONSESSION={{sessionCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrfToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
X-Tenant: {{orgao}}

< ../../payloads/hr/ergon_chefia_substituicoes_create_ausencia_eventual.json
